            \par Agency SL                                                                                                         VSLXX \par Capital               JOCXX                                                                                       \par IM Shares             JOIXX                                                                                       \par Institutional Class   JOFXX                                                                                       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (each a 'Fund,' and collectively, the 'Money Market Funds' or 'Funds')\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This Statement of Additional Information ('SAI') is not a prospectus but contains additional information which should be read in conjunction with the prospectuses for the Funds dated July 1, 2020, as supplemented from time to time (collectively, the 'Prospectuses'). \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1217286/000119312520134603/d827048dncsr.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Additionally, this SAI incorporates by reference the audited financial statements dated February 29, 2020, included in the annual Shareholder Reports relating to the Funds (the 'Financial Statements').}}}\uc2 \f2  The Prospectuses and the Financial Statements, including the Independent Registered Public Accounting Firm's reports, are available without charge upon request by contacting \f28 \uc2 \f2 JPMorgan Distribution Services, Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . ('JPMDS' or the 'Distributor'), the Funds' distributor, at 1111 Polaris Parkway, Columbus, OH, 43240.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This SAI is divided into two Parts - Part I and Part II. Part I of this SAI contains information that is particular to each Fund. Part II of this SAI contains information that generally applies to the Funds and other J.P. Morgan Funds. For more information about the Funds or the Financial Statements, simply write or call:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Morgan Shares and Class C Shares:                  