er Bidco Group and/or the Wider PureCircle Group, in either case, taken as a whole;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (vi) require any member of the Wider PureCircle Group or the Wider Bidco Group to relinquish, terminate or amend any contract to which any member of the Wider PureCircle Group or the Wider Bidco Group is a party (in each case to an extent which is material in the context of the Wider Bidco Group or the Wider PureCircle Group taken as a whole);\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (vii) result in any member of the Wider PureCircle Group or any member of the Wider Bidco Group ceasing to be able to carry on business under any name under which it currently does so in any jurisdiction;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (viii) other than in the context of the proposed Bidco Equity Injection and the PureCircle Equity Injection, require any member of the Wider Bidco Group or any member of the Wider PureCircle Group or any of their respective affiliates to: (A) invest, contribute or loan any capital or assets to; or (B) guarantee or pledge capital assets for the benefit of any member of the Wider PureCircle Group or any member of the Wider PureCircle Group, which in each such case or together is material and adverse in the context of any member of the Wider Bidco Group or any member of the Wider PureCircle Group or in the context of the Acquisition;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (ix) except as Disclosed, otherwise adversely affect all or any of the business, assets, liabilities, profits, financial or trading position or prospects of any member of the Wider PureCircle Group or any member of the Wider Bidco Group, to an extent which is material in the context of the Wider PureCircle Group or the Wider Bidco Group, in either case taken as a whole,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 and all applicable waiting and other time periods (including any extensions thereof) during which any such Third Party could decide to take, institute, implement or threaten any such action, proceeding, suit, investigation, enquiry or ref