\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Pause in  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 569 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced at the end of last week the suspension of the sale of dollars, as part of its exchange rate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  programme announced in November. This program considers both the sale of dollars each week and loan transactions at different installments in the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The Bank's announcement temporarily suspends the sale of dollars, but keeps lending \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in place.The issuing institute's decision was expected, although it is not without problems. It should be recalled that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  programme was announced in late November, at a time of high stress in the financial market, with very significant increases in interest rates and a depreciation of the peso - the exchange rate had been around $830 per dollar - , and when there were particularly complex days within the social crisis that has hit the country since 18 October.\par \par \uc2  The speed and aggressiveness of this adjustment led Central to implement the aforementioned unprecedented $10 billion sales program, along with an equivalent loan program.The objective of both shares was not to set a specific price for the value of the peso, but to avoid excessive volatility, as was observed at the time. In other words, the aim was to avoid excessively abrupt movements that could lead to problems in the financial market. Since then, both because of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  itself and for greater calm in foreign markets -- especially related to China-U.S. trade agreements -- the peso has appreciated considerably and volatility also fell. It is therefore natural that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been reducing its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market, and that this week it announced the suspension of the spot market.However, the decision to stop selling incorporates significant risk for the Bank. On the one hand, it is inevitable that this can be seen as the establishment by the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of an objective value for the dollar. Although the entity has been explicit about not pursuing a particular price level, many market players have interpreted Friday's announcement in this logic. Therefore, the issuing body should be very careful in its communication, in order to prevent its decisions from being interpreted as a signal against maximum and minimum amounts for the value of the dollar to which it would be willing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .A second risk stems from the fact that the situation in Chile remains highly uncertain, and that the outlook abroad is also highly uncertain. Indeed, in the latter area, relief from trade war agreements has been altered by the effects of the growing conflict between the United States and Iran, which threatens stability in one of the world's most troubled areas. This has led to a sharp depreciation of the peso in recent days.The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not make its exchange rate policy subject to each of the swings of the international economy, since this would inevitably go against the consolidated \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  flotation strategy. Therefore, issues such as the daily evolution of the problems between Iran and the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not define the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  plan. However, it is inevitable that the market does not clearly distinguish causes and effects, so that a new episode of volatility could again induce pressure to resume \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , regardless of its causes. The issuing institute must be particularly clear in its communication from now on regarding the conditions defining its act on the spot market.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200214eg17006dl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
