\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par --  Net interest income improved by 4% to GBP2,784 million principally driven \par      by improved margins and an additional day in the quarter. \par  \par --  NIM increased by 10 basis points to 2.22%, driven by lower funding costs, \par      reflecting repricing initiatives across a number of businesses, RCR run-off \par      and a small number of one-off recoveries. \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Q2 2014 compared with Q2 2013\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par --  Net interest income improved by 1% to GBP2,784 million reflected by improved \par      margins. \par  \par --  NIM increased by 22 basis points to 2.22% benefiting from repricing initiatives \par      across a number of businesses. \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 01-08-14 0601GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Analysis of results\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                             Half year ended         Quarter ended \par                            =================  ========================== \par                             30 June  30 June  30 June  31 March  30 June \par                                2014     2013     2014      2014     2013 \par Non-interest income            GBPm     GBPm     GBPm      GBPm     GBPm \par =========================  ========  =======  =======  ========  ======= \par  \par Net fees and commissions      2,118    2,248    1,063     1,055    1,142 \par Income from trading \par  activities                   1,482    1,890      626       856      874 \par Other operating income          882    1,028      438       444      661 \par =========================  ========  =======  =======  ========  ======= \par  \par Total non-interest \par  income                       4,482    5,166    2,127     2,355    2,677 \par =========================  ========  =======  =======  ========  ======= \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Key points\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 H1 2014 compared with H1 2013\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par --  Non-interest inco