ints for the other two notes. Interest is payable quarterly in arrears. The notes were each redeemable at the discretion of the issuer on 15 September 2011.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 10 Intangible assets and goodwill\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Group's intangible assets relate to the purchase of syndicate capacity, distribution channels and US surplus lines authorisations. Goodwill represents the excess of purchase price over the net fair value of identifiable assets acquired and liabilities assumed in a business combination.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Net intangible assets and goodwill as at 31 December 2012 and 2011 consist of the following:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                               Indefinite \par                                                     life   Finite life \par US dollars in millions            Goodwill   intangibles   intangibles  Total \par --------------------------------  --------  ------------  ------------  ----- \par Net value at 1 January \par  2011                                  $77          $637            $2   $716 \par --------------------------------  --------  ------------  ------------  ----- \par Movements during 2011: \par    Acquisitions                          -             3             -      3 \par    Amortisation charge                   -             -           (2)    (2) \par --------------------------------  --------  ------------  ------------  ----- \par Total movements during \par  2011                                    -             3           (2)      1 \par --------------------------------  --------  ------------  ------------  ----- \par Net value at 31 December \par  2011                                  $77          $640            $-   $717 \par --------------------------------  --------  ------------  ------------  ----- \par Movements during 2012: \par    \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  revaluation          3             -             -  