 except for those which cannot be delegated pursuant to the provisions of the Capital Companies Act (Ley de Sociedades de Capital) and Board Regulations (Reglamentos del Consejo).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 At the date of these Listing Particulars, the Executive Committee was composed of the following six directors:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                                    Name                                                      Position \par ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  ---------- \par  Angel Ron                                                                                                   Chairman \par  Guimil................................................................................................... \par  ...................... \par  Eric Gancedo                                                                                                Member \par  Holmer................................................................................................... \par  ................ \par  Luis Herrando Prat de la                                                                                    Member \par  Riba..................................................................................................... \par  .. \par  Jose Ramon Rodriguez                                                                                        Member \par  Garcia................................................................................................... \par  .... \par  Roberto Higuera                                                                                             Member \par  Montejo.................................................................................................. \par  ........... \par  Francisco Aparicio                                                                                          Secretary \par  Valls.................................................................................................... \par  ........... \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The resolutions adopted by the Executive Committee do not require subsequent ratification by a meeting of the Board of Directors, although the Executive Committee does inform the Board of Directors about the matters dealt with and the decisions adopted in its meetings.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Audit and Control Committee\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Audit and Control Committee is entrusted with the task of assisting the Board of Directors in its functions of overseeing and controlling the Issuer by means of the evaluation of the Issuer's auditing system, the verification of the independence of the external auditor and the review of the internal control systems. The role of this committee is fundamentally informative and consultative, although, on an exceptional basis, the Board of Directors may delegate decision-making powers to it.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 At the date of these Listing Particulars, the Audit and Control Committee was composed of the following four directors:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                                    Name                                                      Position \par ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  ----------- \par  Jose Ramon Rodriguez                                                                                       Chairman \par  Garcia.................................................................................................. \par  .... \par  Eric Gancedo                                                                                               Member \par  Holmer.................................................................................................. \par  ................ \par  M. Angel Solis                                                                                           